  Applications</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">AgentScope enhances agentic applications by providing flexible tool-based interactions, unified interfaces, and advanced infrastructure based on the ReAct paradigm, supporting efficient and safe development and deployment.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="mb-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><ul class="flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row-reverse    text-xs "><!--[--><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Zitao Li" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Dawei Gao" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Listen0425" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/b1b79330df4d36c6d895598131f56ec6.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="qbc" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/3ca1baac62551260ded0d249f218e63d.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dar