><!----> zx-Wu</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-6"><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2611.04894" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-balance">VisSearch-Bench: Evaluating Long Horizon Visual Search in Multimodal Agents</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">VisSearch-Bench evaluates multimodal agents on visually intensive search tasks that require integrating visual context with external information, showing that even the best system fully solves only 26.47% of tasks.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[0--><a href="/antgroup" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/662e1f9da266499277937d33/7VcPHdLSGlged3ixK1dys.jpeg" alt="antgroup" class="size-3 rounded-sm"/><!--]--> <span class="block min-w-0 truncate font-medium">Ant Group</span></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-2">·</span> <span>Published on Nov 3, 2026</span><!--]--></div></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex w-40 flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-2 p-4"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1  z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8"><!--[0--><a href="/login?next=%2Fpapers%2F2611.04894" class="self-start"><!--[0--><!----><div role="checkbox" class="shadow-alternate group flex h-9 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border pl-3 pr-3.5 border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-850 w-full justify-center text-sm border border-gray-200 