2186.png" decoding="async" alt="" class="size-full object-cover object-center opacity-80 dark:opacity-70 dark:invert invisible" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/></div><!----></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="shadow-xs pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2 right-2 flex h-6 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border bg-white px-2 text-xs leading-none text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">Submitted by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6039478ab3ecf716b1a5fd4d/_Thy4E7taiSYBLKxEKJbT.jpeg" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> taesiri</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b p-4"><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2509.22186" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer">MinerU2.5: A Decoupled Vision-Language Model for Efficient
