<p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">SUPRA-Tex decouples visible-material estimation, surface alignment, and 3D completion to generate relightable 3D materials that preserve reference image details and complete unobserved surfaces.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><ul class="flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row-reverse    text-xs "><!--[--><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Jichen Pang" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Inso" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/631b24f2f6bc4be4a64c4d43/P9_tVF7SESmVxxGKVCgCk.jpeg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="fpmeng01" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/35c378cf709ede1dc124a4762a1442ab.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="JieminFang" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/7087ea6897942f2f6b822b1587ce1248.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-ful