ed by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="/avatars/18fd2a1cfcf28554ee35b13447790e34.svg" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> supra3d</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b p-4"><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2610.22352" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer">SUPRA-TEX: 3D Generation with Super-Aligned Texture</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">SUPRA-Tex decouples visible-material estimation, surface alignment, and 3D completion to generate relightable 3D materials that preserve reference image details and complete unobserved surfaces.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="mb-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><ul class="flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row-reverse    text-xs "><!--[--><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Jichen Pang" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Inso" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/631b24f2f6bc4be4a64c4d43/P9_tVF7SESmVxxGKVCgCk.jpeg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="fpmeng01" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" a